1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:05,170 --> 00:02:06,780
Damn it,

25
00:02:06,610 --> 00:02:08,370
the Return Cauldron malfunctioned

26
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,580
and sent us to the moon !

27
00:02:09,330 --> 00:02:11,580
Fortunately we're back now.

28
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:13,220
Fellow cultivator,

29
00:02:12,970 --> 00:02:16,250
has anything major happened on planet Suzaku lately ?

30
00:02:16,330 --> 00:02:19,570
The biggest thing is, of course, the person named Ceng Niu.

31
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:21,050
Ceng Niu ?

32
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:23,300
Yes, Ceng Niu.

33
00:02:23,130 --> 00:02:25,820
Red Butterfly lost an arm because of him !

34
00:02:25,970 --> 00:02:28,250
What does this Ceng Niu look like ?

35
00:02:29,690 --> 00:02:30,810
Senior,

36
00:02:30,730 --> 00:02:33,050
Junior doesn't know anything.

37
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:37,170
The country of Suzaku hasn't released any news about him either.

38
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,770
They didn't put a bounty on my head ?

39
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,250
Something fishy is going on.

40
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,810
Little girl is honest and smart,

41
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,090
not bad.

42
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:49,810
This bottle of pills will help you reach Core Formation.

43
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,530
Shattered Earth Pill !?

44
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:06,850
Disciple, you have great fortune !

45
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,370
Is that so ?

46
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,730
It's been a long time

47
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,530
and I don't know what happened to Wan'er.

48
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,130
It's time to go home.

49
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:22,860
Qingtian Sect
Country of Chu's border

50
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,340
What's going on ?

51
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,290
Enemy attack !

52
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:32,490
What kind of monsters are they ?

53
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,210
You guys are still hungry, right ?

54
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,570
We've only eaten 12 sects.

55
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:41,090
The trip to the Celestial Realm was too expensive,

56
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:43,730
let's recover by eating the country of Chu !

57
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,410
Maiwu Yi
Qingtian Sect Leader
Middle stage Nascent Soul

58
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:55,410
Chu is a vassal of the Giant Demon Clan.

59
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,530
Lord Envoy

60
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:05,610
won't forgive you for this !

61
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:09,290
Lord Envoy ?

62
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,690
Giant Demon Clan Envoy
Soul Formation

63
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,970
Heaven's Tower
Country of Chu

64
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,570
It's him !

65
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,650
According to the Elders of the clan,

66
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:16,010
although he's only Early stage Soul Formation.

67
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,050
He is one of the 6 cultivators of Suzaku who went to the Celestial Realm.

68
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:20,210
He isn't simple.

69
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:29,600
Zhan Bai of the Insect Demon Sect,

70
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,650
you deceived your master

71
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,130
and stole your sect's sacred texts !

72
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,130
You are wanted by the country of Puli !

73
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,690
I advise you to leave quickly !

74
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,930
Otherwise, once it's known that you're here,

75
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,250
they will come to kill you !

76
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,970
A Soul Formation cultivator

77
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:49,530
will be much more nourishing than Core Formations or Nascent Souls...

78
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,770
Madman !

79
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,090
It's a pity...

80
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,890
I didn't get to eat him.

81
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:17,010
This trip to the Celestial Realm was humiliating !

82
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,330
If it weren't for that Ceng Niu,

83
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,850
I wouldn't be in such a sorry state !

84
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,690
I should've been the one

85
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,090
to become famous !

86
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,490
However,

87
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,890
since he cut off Red Butterfly's arm,

88
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,650
I'm sure he's not Early stage Soul Formation.

89
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,410
He isn't to be messed with

90
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:39,290
before I have a breakthrough.

91
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,930
Sect Leader,

92
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,330
your health is important.

93
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:07,610
Playing the zither is a strain on your mind.

94
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,330
Did you find where that person comes from ?

95
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,170
I just know he's not very old.

96
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,650
A month ago,

97
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:18,130
he appeared at the border of Chu

98
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:21,050
and destroyed 12 sects in 7 days,

99
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,800
killing Nascent Soul Elders in the process.

100
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:26,810
I don't know who his next target will be.

101
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,130
In a few days,

102
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,410
when I’m feeling better,

103
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:39,170
I will return your Soul Blood.

104
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,210
Sect Leader !

105
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:43,050
All of you should run away afterward.

106
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:46,810
If only Ceng Niu could come to our country,

107
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,590
then this disaster would be resolved.

108
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:50,370
Ceng Niu

109
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:54,530
probably hasn’t even heard of Chu.

110
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:58,010
The Cloud Sky Sect

111
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,450
won't be able to avoid this disaster.

112
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:07,660
In these past 100 years, she failed at Nascent Soul 3 times

113
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,250
despite taking many pills.

114
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:13,970
If it wasn’t for the fact that she wanted to see that person one more time,

115
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:17,170
she would have died 30 years ago

116
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,570
when she failed to breakthrough again…

117
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:26,330
The foreign cultivator is going to wipe out the country of Chu.

118
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,930
Even the Giant Demon Clan don't dare to intervene.

119
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,450
Even if he was here,

120
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:35,650
I'm afraid he wouldn't be able to save the Cloud Sky Sect.

121
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,930
Chu has many factions.

122
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:41,050
The Cloud Sky Sect is not safe.

123
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,010
You...

124
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,770
Wan'er has been in the Cloud Sky Sect for a long time

125
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:48,210
so I can take care of these things myself.

126
00:07:48,170 --> 00:07:51,080
Note: This part was cut from episode 44.

127
00:07:51,040 --> 00:07:52,130
This is...

128
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,770
A devil I raised,

129
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,170
you can call it out

130
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,810
with a single thought.

131
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,730
From now on,

132
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:10,170
you must protect Wan'er at all times.

133
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:14,810
From now on, I'll call you Little Ling.

134
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,290
Senior...

135
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,010
Little Ling,

136
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,930
when will

137
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:31,370
your master come back ?

138
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,770
I haven't seen Wan'er in a while,

139
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,650
I should buy something for her...

140
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:49,610
Treasure Refining Pavilion
Sea of Devils
Devil Rebel City

141
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,850
Treasure Refining Pavilion

142
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,130
Welcome Sir,

143
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:54,610
what would you like to buy ?

144
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,810
A pill recipe,

145
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,850
at least grade 5.

146
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,300
Grade 5 pills recipes are very expensive.

147
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:04,170
Our pavilion only has 3.

148
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,490
Please wait here,

149
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,970
I'll get them for you.

150
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,570
Yes that's right...

151
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,610
Sir,

152
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,580
we have 3 grade 5 pill recipes.

153
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,710
2 of them.

154
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:16,770
are from Chu's Cloud Sky Sect.

155
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:20,530
And the other one is from Da Mo’s End of the World Sect.

156
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:23,250
They are all top quality pill recipes.

157
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,400
These jades contain the effect of the pills.

158
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,250
Please have a look.

159
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,250
No need.

160
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:30,530
I want this pill recipe from the End of the World Sect.

161
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,890
Do you have any

162
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,450
grade 6 pill recipes ?

163
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,810
A grade 6 pill recipe

164
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,650
is a priceless item.

165
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,610
My Treasure Refining Pavilion only has one.

166
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,370
But this item,

167
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:45,810
will be sold at the Sea of Devils auction that happens every 10 years.

168
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:48,770
If Sir wants it, why don't you wait 2 months ?

169
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,770
The auction is in 2 months.

170
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,690
Nevermind.

171
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,210
How much for this one ?

172
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:56,410
Sir, do you want to exchange items

173
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,570
or buy with spirit stones ?

174
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,490
Spirit stones.

175
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,370
This...

176
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:03,810
Items that have reached a certain value

177
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:06,690
are not sold for spirit stones.

178
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,530
Sir !

179
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,530
Sh...Shopkeeper...

180
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,330
This is...

181
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,210
a top-quality spirit stone !

182
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:40,250
Luoyue Sect
Country of Chu

183
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:54,530
This food is tasteless.

184
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,810
I heard that the biggest sect in Chu

185
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,330
has a beauty as the Sect Leader.

186
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,690
What was its name ?

187
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:04,290
Cloud Sky Sect ?

188
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,250
I'd like to see

189
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:12,730
that beauty get devoured by insects.

190
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:15,090
What could be more beautiful ?

191
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,450
How dare you do this to the country of Chu ?

192
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,850
Don't you know that Wang Lin from the Cloud Sky Sect

193
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,450
won't forgive you !?

194
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,330
Wang Lin ?

195
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,730
Never heard of him.

196
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:39,010
Only a handful of Soul Formation cultivators can fight me,

197
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:43,770
the rest are just meat on my plate.

198
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:55,330
The newly opened Chen's Tavern

199
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,210
sells 20% off !

200
00:11:57,760 --> 00:11:58,890
Did you hear

201
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,770
that a mysterious person appeared in the Sea of Devils.

202
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,650
He bought a pill recipe at a high price.

203
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:06,450
The store was about to throw him out

204
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,890
but he forcefully took the item

205
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:10,130
and still paid them.

206
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,090
He went to many shops of the Sea of Devils

207
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:15,370
where there's no shortage of Nascent Souls.

208
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,850
Nascent Soul ?

209
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:18,170
I'm shocked !

210
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:21,610
Congratulations, Master.

211
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:24,370
In 10 days, you have purchased 8 grade 5 pill recipes !

212
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:26,490
If Wan'er sees these,

213
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:28,170
she will be happy.

214
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,290
Country of Chu...

215
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,570
I'm finally back.

216
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:37,770
This is...

217
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:40,490
An inner demon ?!

218
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,690
Not possible.

219
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,930
With my cultivation,

220
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,930
a normal inner demon could never enter my Origin Soul.

221
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,050
I will kill you !

222
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,290
This battle will be dangerous.

223
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:08,090
Those who want to leave are free to go.

224
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:10,410
If it weren't for Sect Leader's help,

225
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,810
I would never have reached Nascent Soul.

226
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,170
In this difficult time,

227
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:17,010
there is no reason to abandon you.

228
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:20,130
I swear to stand by your side !

229
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,010
It's thanks to Sect Leader

230
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:26,010
that the Cloud Sky Sect has more than 10 Nascent Soul cultivators.

231
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,890
We are indebted to you.

232
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:30,770
Today, I swear to protect Sect Leader.

233
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:33,530
I will never let Sect Leader down.

234
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:35,530
We will follow you until death !

235
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,530
We will follow you until death !

236
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,450
We will follow you until death !

237
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:53,170
Listen well, Cloud Sky Sect.

238
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,130
Bring out all your pills

239
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,660
and your Sect Leader is to come out

240
00:13:57,440 --> 00:14:00,090
to greet me personally.

241
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:03,170
Senior is a Soul Formation cultivator,

242
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:05,680
please don’t make it difficult for a small sect like ours.

243
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:07,370
If Senior needs any pills,

244
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,110
you can just ask us.

245
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:11,730
My Cloud Sky Sect will do its best to fulfill your needs.

246
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:14,050
I guess you are the Sect Leader.

247
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,210
Give me the pills !

248
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:22,690
This formation is mysterious.

249
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,490
Senior,

250
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:26,370
this formation was placed up by the Giant Demon Clan

251
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,330
to protect my sect.

252
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:29,570
Consider giving the Giant Demon Clan some face

253
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,290
and don't make it difficult for us.

254
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,050
The Giant Demon Clan ?

255
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:43,770
You might as well call them now.

256
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:48,130
Let's see if young master Chi Hu comes himself to save you !

257
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,310
The Cloud Sky Formation

258
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,490
won't hold for long.

259
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,890
I will do my best !

260
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:19,330
Protect the disciples

261
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,330
with all your might !

262
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,330
The disciples will retreat first !

263
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,010
Yes !

264
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,130
Hurry, retreat !

265
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:43,930
You really are a beauty...

266
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:48,290
You must taste very good.

267
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:50,530
What's your name ?

268
00:15:52,660 --> 00:15:54,770
Oh? Not going to speak ?

269
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,850
That’s too bad !

270
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:57,850
What the hell !?

271
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:00,730
Stop !

272
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:02,010
My name is Li Muwan !

273
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,130
Senior,

274
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:09,450
if you have any request, please speak.

275
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,930
My request ?

276
00:16:10,910 --> 00:16:12,250
I’m going to kill you all,

277
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,770
take all the pills,

278
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:16,290
and seal this place to be my personal palace.

279
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:20,210
As for you, you can be my maid.

280
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:22,530
You went too far !

281
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:35,410
It looks like I was too kind.

282
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:40,890
What the hell !?

283
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:50,050
Cloud Sky Sect...

284
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,170
Break !

285
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,170
Sect Leader, be careful !

286
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,370
No !

287
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:24,730
You've got a few tricks up your sleeve...

288
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:33,410
Senior,

289
00:17:33,600 --> 00:17:37,050
I don't think Wan'er can wait for you anymore.

290
00:17:37,120 --> 00:17:38,890
With your cultivation,

291
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:42,970
how did you get the position of Cloud Sky Sect Leader ?

292
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,490
Because

293
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:51,650
she is my woman.

294
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,770
Ceng Niu !?

295
00:18:13,860 --> 00:20:44,460
The following scene was changed in the donghua. In the novel, Wang Lin is anxious to meet Li Muwan again and confuses that feeling of love with an inner demon disturbing his cultivation. In the donghua, they adapted the scene as if he was sensing danger through the Divine Sense he left with Li Muwan.

Wang Lin didn’t stop at all during this 800 000 li trip.
He stood on the edge of the Sea of Devils looking toward Chu, and for some reason his heart trembled slightly. He had never felt it trembling like this before; this was the first time it ever happened.
“Inner demon ? Not possible. With my cultivation, a normal inner demon could never enter my Origin Soul.” While Wang Lin thought about it, he walked into the Sea of Devils.
“I haven’t seen Wan Er in many years. I should buy something for her… ” Wang Lin let out a faint smile.

296
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:33,010
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

297
00:18:32,830 --> 00:18:39,170
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

298
00:18:39,030 --> 00:18:43,110
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

299
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:47,040
and like many other unseparable things.

300
00:18:47,150 --> 00:18:53,050
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

301
00:18:53,980 --> 00:19:00,060
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

302
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:05,910
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

303
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:10,590
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

304
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:14,080
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

305
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:20,070
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

306
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:24,270
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

307
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:28,190
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

308
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:34,040
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

309
00:19:34,050 --> 00:19:37,970
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

310
00:19:37,930 --> 00:19:41,750
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

311
00:19:41,620 --> 00:19:47,790
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

312
00:19:47,610 --> 00:19:51,870
